<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks rose, seven fell and four were flat in 15.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,607.9 points, 1.1 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell one percent in an 11.8-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
